    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents an asynchronous game operation. These are usually created by event interpreters. When an async operation starts, the entire game loop is supposed to suspend, perform the async operation, and then resume from the suspension point. </para>
